{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"case","roleHeading":"Case","externalID":"s:6EidKit17PassiveAuthStatusO12notSupportedyA2CmF","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"notSupported"}],"title":"PassiveAuthStatus.notSupported","modules":[{"name":"EidKit"}],"role":"symbol"},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus\/notSupported"},"abstract":[{"text":"Passive auth could not be performed because the card’s ICAO data group files (SOD\/DG2\/DG7)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are not accessible in the current session context.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"notSupported","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"On iOS, this occurs because the system NFC stack always pre-selects the national AID1","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"applet before the SDK receives the tag. The card’s security policy blocks cross-applet","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"access to the ICAO applet from within an AID1 secure messaging session.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This is a platform constraint, not an SDK error. Passive auth works normally on Android.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit","doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/eidkit\/passiveauthstatus\/notsupported"]}],"references":{"doc://EidKit/documentation/EidKit":{"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\